@page "/ux-design"
@layout EmptyLayout

<div class="ux-page">
	<header class="ux-header">
		<div class="ux-logo"><span>O</span> ORBITAL</div>
		<p>UX direction / 01</p>
	</header>

	<main>
		<section class="intro">
			<p class="label">Visual identity</p>
			<h1>A clear way to<br /><strong>see the future.</strong></h1>
			<p class="intro-text">Een compacte visuele richting voor een ruimtevaart-app die futuristisch voelt, maar eenvoudig blijft voor de gebruiker.</p>
		</section>

		<section class="ux-section">
			<div class="section-heading">
				<p class="label">01 / Colors</p>
				<h2>Space, made welcoming.</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="palette">
				<div class="swatch swatch-purple"><b>Cosmic purple</b><span>#6D4AFF</span></div>
				<div class="swatch swatch-navy"><b>Deep space</b><span>#121A3A</span></div>
				<div class="swatch swatch-blue"><b>Orbit blue</b><span>#A9D9FF</span></div>
				<div class="swatch swatch-white"><b>Moon white</b><span>#FFFFFF</span></div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="ux-section">
			<div class="section-heading">
				<p class="label">02 / Typography</p>
				<h2>Readable at every distance.</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="type-grid">
				<div class="type-sample display-sample">
					<span class="label">Headings / Space Grotesk / geometric sans-serif</span>
					<p>Explore<br /><em>new worlds.</em></p>
				</div>
				<div class="type-sample body-sample">
					<span class="label">Body / Inter / neutral sans-serif</span>
					<p>We gebruiken sans-serif fonts voor de hele interface. Space Grotesk geeft de headings een futuristische uitstraling en Inter houdt lopende tekst, knoppen en informatie rustig en leesbaar.</p>
					<span class="type-meta">Aa Bb Cc 123</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="ux-section">
			<div class="section-heading">
				<p class="label">03 / Photography</p>
				<h2>Real places, imagined journeys.</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="photo-grid">
				<figure>
					<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1614728894747-a83421e2b9c9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Het oppervlak van Mars" />
					<figcaption>Planets / atmospheric and recognisable</figcaption>
				</figure>
				<figure>
					<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1446776811953-b23d57bd21aa?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="De aarde vanuit de ruimte" />
					<figcaption>Space / immersive, not overly dark</figcaption>
				</figure>
			</div>
			<p class="photo-note">Fotografie toont de bestemming echt. We gebruiken geen drukke beelden achter belangrijke tekst en houden de interface licht en overzichtelijk.</p>
		</section>

		<section class="ux-section interface-section">
			<div class="section-heading"><p class="label">04 / Buttons</p><h2>Actions in different shapes.</h2></div>
			<p class="section-intro">Buttons krijgen verschillende groottes en vormen, afhankelijk van het belang van de actie.</p>
			<div class="component-demo component-demo-wide">
				<span class="label">Button variants</span>
				<!-- Main action -->
				<div class="button-row button-row-large"><span class="button button-primary button-wide">Primary action</span><span class="button button-secondary">Secondary</span><span class="button button-outline-blue">Outline blue</span></div>
				<!-- Size variants -->
				<div class="button-row"><span class="button button-navy">Navy</span><span class="button button-navy button-compact">Compact</span><span class="button button-pill">Pill button</span><span class="button button-text">Text only &#8594;</span></div>
				<!-- Icon variants -->
				<div class="button-row"><span class="button button-icon">&#8594;</span><span class="button button-circle">&#8594;</span><span class="button button-square">+</span><span class="button button-close">&#10005;</span><span class="button button-disabled">Disabled</span></div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="ux-section interface-section">
			<div class="section-heading"><p class="label">05 / Navbars</p><h2>Navigation with a clear direction.</h2></div>
			<p class="section-intro">Drie eenvoudige navbar-richtingen binnen hetzelfde Orbital-kleurenthema.</p>
			<div class="navbar-list">
				<div class="navigation-demo"><span class="label">Open navbar</span><div class="demo-navbar"><strong>ORBITAL</strong><nav><span>Home</span><span>Destinations</span><span>Transport</span></nav><span class="demo-menu">Menu</span></div></div>
				<div class="navigation-demo"><span class="label">Contrast navbar</span><div class="demo-navbar demo-navbar-contrast"><strong>ORBITAL</strong><nav><span>Explore</span><span>About</span></nav><span class="demo-menu">&#9776;</span></div></div>
				<div class="navigation-demo"><span class="label">Brand navbar</span><div class="demo-navbar demo-navbar-logo"><span class="nav-logo-mark">O</span><strong>ORBITAL</strong><nav><span>Explore</span><span>Menu</span></nav></div></div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="ux-section interface-section">
			<div class="section-heading"><p class="label">06 / Sidebar</p><h2>Structure for focused pages.</h2></div>
			<p class="section-intro">Een sidebar kan langere pagina’s en dashboards overzichtelijk houden.</p>
			<div class="sidebar-options"><div class="sidebar-demo"><span class="label">Focused sidebar</span><div class="demo-sidebar"><strong>ORBITAL</strong><span class="sidebar-active">Overview</span><span>Destinations</span><span>Transport</span><span>Settings</span></div></div><div class="sidebar-demo sidebar-demo-open"><span class="label">Open sidebar</span><div class="demo-sidebar"><strong>ORBITAL</strong><span class="sidebar-active">Overview</span><span>Destinations</span><span>Transport</span><span>Settings</span></div></div></div>
		</section>

		<section class="ux-section interface-section">
			<div class="section-heading"><p class="label">07 / Burger menu</p><h2>Compact navigation for mobile.</h2></div>
			<p class="section-intro">Een verzameling kleine burger-menu opties binnen één designrichting.</p>
			<div class="burger-showcase">
				<span class="label">Burger menu variants</span>
				<div class="burger-choice-row">
					<div class="burger-choice burger-choice-purple"><span class="burger-lines"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></div>
					<div class="burger-choice burger-choice-blue"><span class="burger-lines burger-lines-navy"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></div>
					<div class="burger-choice burger-choice-circle"><span class="burger-lines burger-lines-blue"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></div>
					<div class="burger-choice burger-choice-outline"><span class="burger-lines burger-lines-purple"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></div>
					<div class="burger-choice burger-choice-close"><span class="burger-close-lines"><span></span><span></span></span></div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="ux-section last-section interface-section">
			<div class="section-heading"><p class="label">08 / Footer</p><h2>A quiet ending to the page.</h2></div>
			<p class="section-intro">De footer blijft rustig en bevat alleen de belangrijkste informatie.</p>
			<div class="footer-options">
				<div class="footer-demo"><span class="label">Open footer</span><div class="demo-footer"><div class="footer-brand"><span class="nav-logo-mark">O</span><strong>ORBITAL</strong></div><p class="footer-description">Space travel made clear, curious and easy to explore.</p><div class="footer-content"><div><span class="footer-group-title">Explore</span><div class="footer-links"><a href="#">Destinations</a><a href="#">Transport</a><a href="#">About</a></div></div><div><span class="footer-group-title">Socials</span><div class="footer-links"><a href="#">Instagram</a><a href="#">YouTube</a><a href="#">Contact</a></div></div></div><div class="footer-legal"><a href="#">Privacy</a><a href="#">Terms</a><a href="#">Cookies</a></div></div></div>
				<div class="footer-demo"><span class="label">Contrast footer</span><div class="demo-footer demo-footer-contrast"><div class="footer-brand"><span class="nav-logo-mark">O</span><strong>ORBITAL</strong></div><p class="footer-description">Explore beyond the familiar and find your next destination.</p><div class="footer-content"><div><span class="footer-group-title">Discover</span><div class="footer-links"><a href="#">Planets</a><a href="#">Experiences</a><a href="#">Journal</a></div></div><div><span class="footer-group-title">Socials</span><div class="footer-links"><a href="#">Instagram</a><a href="#">TikTok</a><a href="#">Support</a></div></div></div><div class="footer-legal"><a href="#">Privacy policy</a><a href="#">Terms of use</a><a href="#">Cookie policy</a></div></div></div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</div>

